# ==============================================================================
# KCEX Authentication Credentials
# ==============================================================================
# Because KCEX does not provide an official API key portal, the bot interacts with
# the KCEX Futures platform using authenticated session headers as observed in
# browser network requests (DevTools -> Network -> any private /fapi/v1/ request).
#
# HOW TO OBTAIN:
# 1. Log in to your KCEX account at https://www.kcex.com/futures/exchange
# 2. Press F12 to open Developer Tools and select the "Network" tab.
# 3. Filter by "fapi" or click on any private request like "assets", "open_positions", or "order/create".
# 4. Under "Request Headers":
#    - Copy the value of "Authorization" (paste below into KCEX_AUTH_TOKEN)
#    - Copy the value of "User-Device" (optional, but recommended; paste into KCEX_USER_DEVICE)
#    - Copy the value of "Cookie" (optional; paste into KCEX_COOKIE)
# ==============================================================================

# Your KCEX Authorization token (starts with your session token or JWT)
KCEX_AUTH_TOKEN=WEBfc2d69a638b7c92cfeeb5405153fb0067812fc2edb3f86cba666785e77273fd9

